// Puts tab number rbi_k at rbi_cx on the tab strip whose top is rbi_y: as wide as its name in the bold face (the open tab's) and the padding on both sides, as high as the strip. Answers its width.
ribbon_fit_place_tab(int ribbon_fit_tab_number, int ribbon_fit_tab_left, int ribbon_fit_tab_top) {
